      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It sounds like you're experiencing a profound sense of loss and despair about the state of things around you. When everything feels like it's decaying, the effort to keep going can feel utterly meaningless. Instead of watching the slow collapse, perhaps you could find a very small, immediate point of focus—a single thing you can control or observe right now. Sometimes, acknowledging the depth of the pain is the first step toward finding a different way to navigate it.",
